			(property "Description" "Winstar WH2004A-CFH-JT# 20x4 character LCD (Adafruit #498). HD44780 compatible, FSTN Positive Transflective, RGB common-anode LED backlight. 4-bit or 8-bit parallel. External 10-20k contrast pot on V0. Pins: 1=VSS, 2=VDD, 3=V0, 4=RS, 5=RW, 6=E, 7-14=DB0-DB7, 15=A (backlight anode), 16=R (cathode), 17=G, 18=B."
